      "text": "```python\nimport re\n\ndef filter_script_tags(content: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Remove <script> tags from the content argument and return the result.\"\"\"\n    pattern = re.compile(r'<script[^>]*>.*?</script>', re.IGNORECASE | re.DOTALL)\n    return pattern.sub('', content)\n```",
